/* 铁箱遭遇（RPG.Chest 陷阱宝箱的完整交互）
 * 入口在地窖（cellar.js 的 cellar-entry 场景里有「查看铁箱」选项）
 */

:: 铁箱
<<if setup.DND3.IronChest.locked>>
锁孔里一片死寂——铁箱被彻底锁死了，再怎么摆弄也不会有反应。
<<elseif setup.DND3.IronChest.isDone>>
铁箱敞着口，里面已经空了。
<<else>>
包铁皮的箱子立在墙角，锁孔泛着幽光。硬砸一定砸得开（它可不会闪避），但你隐约觉得箱子里藏着什么机关。
<<if not setup.DND3.IronChest.disarmed and setup.RPG.has("iron-key")>>
[[用铁钥匙开锁|开铁箱]]
<</if>>
<<if not setup.DND3.IronChest.disarmed>>
[[尝试撬锁|撬铁箱]]
<</if>>
<<if setup.RPG.has("club")>>
[[攻击铁箱|攻击铁箱]]
<</if>>
<<if setup.RPG.has("bomb")>>
[[用炸弹炸开铁箱|炸铁箱]]
<</if>>
<</if>>

<<link "回地窖">><<set $sceneId to "cellar-entry">><<goto "场景舞台">><</link>>

:: 开铁箱
<<run setup.DND3.IronChest.used(setup.DND3.Player, setup.DND3.Player, "open")>>

<<link "回地窖">><<set $sceneId to "cellar-entry">><<goto "场景舞台">><</link>>

:: 撬铁箱
<<run setup.DND3.IronChest.used(setup.DND3.Player, setup.DND3.Player, "lockpick")>>

<<link "回地窖">><<set $sceneId to "cellar-entry">><<goto "场景舞台">><</link>>

:: 攻击铁箱
<<run setup.RPG.useItem("club", setup.DND3.IronChest, setup.DND3.Player)>>
<<if setup.DND3.IronChest.isBroken>>
<<run setup.DND3.IronChest.brokenBy(setup.DND3.Player)>>
<</if>>

<<if not setup.DND3.IronChest.isBroken>>
[[继续攻击|攻击铁箱]]
<</if>>
<<link "回地窖">><<set $sceneId to "cellar-entry">><<goto "场景舞台">><</link>>

:: 炸铁箱
<<run setup.RPG.useItem("bomb", setup.DND3.IronChest, setup.DND3.Player)>>
<<if setup.DND3.IronChest.isBroken>>
<<run setup.DND3.IronChest.brokenBy(setup.DND3.Player)>>
<</if>>
硝烟散去，碎木片簌簌落下。

<<link "回地窖">><<set $sceneId to "cellar-entry">><<goto "场景舞台">><</link>>
